<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux trade surplus narrows in June.</title>
<headline>Belgolux trade surplus narrows in June.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   June	 May     June 1995</p>
<p>    Balance			     23.9	31.6	45.8</p>
<p>					Jan-June   Jan-May  Jan-June 95</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 2,565.8   2,151.1   2,594.4</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 2,404.1   2,013.3   2,362.7</p>
<p>    Balance			    161.7     137.8     231.7</p>
<p>PERCENTAGE CHANGE VS YR-AGO PERIOD (VOLUME TERMS)</p>
<p>					Jan-June   Jan-May  Jan-June 95</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	    -3.1	-0.8	10.5</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	    -0.4	 1.0	 7.7</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
